# Observe-only Byteman rules (U3, amendment of 2026-10-27) for bloom_filter_fp_chance-getFilter-maxFalsePosProbability--autonomous,
# unit tier. Loaded into the forked test JVM via -Dtest.jvm.args. Each rule only prints one line to System.out.
# BMBF A <size> <thread>    every MemoryUtil.allocate(size) (JNA Native.malloc), after it returns
# BMBF BA <bytes> <thread>  every OffHeapBitSet(long numBits) constructed, its byte count
# Adapted from harness/bloom_filter_fp_chance-computeBloomSpec-maxFalsePosProb--autonomous/bf.btm (thread name added; that file is not modified).

RULE bmbf malloc
CLASS org.apache.cassandra.utils.memory.MemoryUtil
METHOD allocate(long)
AT EXIT
IF true
DO traceln("BMBF A " + $1 + " " + Thread.currentThread().getName())
ENDRULE

RULE bmbf bitset alloc
CLASS org.apache.cassandra.utils.obs.OffHeapBitSet
METHOD <init>(long)
AT EXIT
IF true
DO traceln("BMBF BA " + $0.offHeapSize() + " " + Thread.currentThread().getName())
ENDRULE
